        "Moreover, column resizing handles must provide accessible keyboard equivalents under WCAG 2.2 Level AA. When a keyboard user focuses a column header, pressing Shift+ArrowRight or Shift+ArrowLeft must expand or contract the column width in ten-pixel increments, accompanied by an assertive live-region speech announcement vocalizing: Column Symbol width 140 pixels."
